// Concept 15 copy of the concepts12-14 box (2026-10-27): Ethernet keystone moved from the bottom to the right wall
// (low, Y30 Z35), off the porch. Four back-wall bosses for the ScreenBeam cradle. Power hole moved from the bottom (X15) to low on the left wall (Y50 Z17).
// Wall-mount box (Brian, 2026-10-22; work/wall-box-wizard/Scope.md). PROPOSED - UNVALIDATED: fit, hinge/latch/snap
// function, wall-mount load and strength are UNKNOWN until printed and tested. Generated by wall_box.py, which
// replaces the parameter block and the keystone block below; edit the template, never a generated copy.
//
// Coordinates: body X 0..wo (width), Y 0..db (depth, front opening at Y=0, back against the wall), Z 0..ho (up).
// The lid covers the front opening at Y -wall..0. Every wall has its own frame: u to the right and v up as seen from
// outside (top/bottom: v towards the back), y into the box, origin at the centre of the wall's usable area.

